  m_text: "Notice to adventurers, in accordance with updates in combat guidelines,
    please keep your quips and one-liners to a minimum, as your opponents are no
    longer required to wait until you're finished before attacking. \n\nIn exchange,
    it's now fair game to attack an evil wizard or warlord if their monologue exceeds
    thirty seconds."
