  m_text: 'Farmers have awoken to a shock, as their <b>scarecrows</b> have up and
    started walking about! They have become territorial of their fields to anyone
    trying to harvest the produce.


    On the advise of local monster experts to
    <i>"Burn it all down first chance you get"</i>, townsfolk may notice a food shortage
    in the coming weeks.'
