  m_text: 'Are you looking to hustle? To rumble? To make a name for yourself in this
    chaotic world we live in? Well come to <b>Jarren''s Outpost</b>, and become a
    legend. Join the Sabres, make a deal with the Blood Cult, and screw over your
    closest allies today!


    Seriously, there''s only one day left to go there,
    you better start running!'
